---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/seo/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME, BRAND_EMAIL, SITE_NAME } from '../lib/seo/site';

const LAST_UPDATED = '1 August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE_NAME} collects, uses and protects your data.`}
  path="/privacy"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy' }]} />

  <section class="px-6 pt-10 pb-20 sm:pt-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>

      <div class="glass mt-10 space-y-8 rounded-[28px] p-7 leading-relaxed text-slate sm:p-10">
        <p>
          This policy explains what data {SITE_NAME} ("Growth Audit", "we", "us") collects when you use{' '}
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white">app.dean-da-dev.co.uk</strong>, why we collect it, and the
          choices you have. Growth Audit is built and operated by {BRAND_NAME}.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">1. Running a free audit</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Running an audit does not require an account. We process the website URL you enter (and, if you provide them,
            an optional business name, business type and location) in order to run the scan and generate your report.
            Anonymous audit results are not linked to your identity and are not saved beyond what's needed to display your
            report.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">2. Creating an account</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">If you create a free account, we collect and store:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>Your email address (and, if you sign up via Google, the name and email associated with that Google account).</li>
            <li>The website(s) you choose to monitor, and the audit results, scores and issue history for those websites.</li>
            <li>Your plan (Free or Pro) and, for Pro subscribers, billing status as provided by our payment processor, Stripe.</li>
            <li>A push notification token, only if you opt in to notifications, so we can alert you when monitoring detects something that needs attention.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">3. How we use your data</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We use the data above only to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>Run audits and scheduled monitoring scans for the websites you've added.</li>
            <li>Show you your website's health history and send push notifications you've opted into.</li>
            <li>Operate the AI Coach feature (Pro plan), which sends your website's scan data to an AI model to generate guidance — see section 5.</li>
            <li>Process payments and manage your subscription, via Stripe.</li>
            <li>Keep the service secure and diagnose technical problems.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your data, and we do not use it for advertising.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">4. Where your data is stored</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Account and website data is stored using Google Firebase (Authentication and Firestore). The application itself
            runs on Cloudflare Workers. Both providers act as data processors on our behalf and maintain their own security
            and compliance standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">5. AI processing</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Audit scoring and the AI Coach feature use AI models — either Cloudflare Workers AI, or Google's Gemini API if
            you've added your own Gemini API key in your account settings. When AI Coach is used, the relevant scan data and
            your question are sent to the model provider to generate a response. This data is used only to generate that
            response and is not used by us to train any model.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">6. Payments</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Pro plan payments are handled entirely by Stripe. We never see or store your full card details — Stripe provides
            us only with your subscription status, which we use to determine your plan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">7. Cookies &amp; local storage</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We use essential cookies/local storage only — to keep you signed in and remember your theme preference (light or
            dark mode). We do not use third-party advertising or tracking cookies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">8. Data retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We keep your account and website data for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, we
            delete your account data within 30 days, except where we're required to retain billing records for legal or tax
            purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">9. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If you're in the UK or EU, you have the right to access, correct, export or delete your personal data, and to
            object to or restrict certain processing. To exercise any of these rights, or to delete your account, email us
            at <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">10. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Growth Audit is intended for business use and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect data from
            anyone under 16.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If we make material changes to this policy, we'll update the date at the top of this page. Continued use of
            Growth Audit after a change means you accept the updated policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">12. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Questions about this policy or your data can be sent to{' '}
            <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
